---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "About Me";
const identity = {
	firstName: "Stefania",
	lastName: "Ionescu",
	occupation: "Student",
	country: "Romania",
	hobbies: ["Catarat", "Stat pe netflix", "Citit"],
};

const skills = ["C++", "C#", "Java"];

const happy = true;
const finished = false;
const goal = 3;

const skillColor = "crimson";
const fontWeight = "bold";
const textCase = "uppercase";

---

<html>
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8"/>
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/>
		<title>{pageTitle}</title>

		<style define:vars={{skillColor, fontWeight, textCase}} is:global>
			
			h1 {
				color: purple;
				font-size: 4rem;
			}
			.skill {
				color: var(--skillColor);
				font-weight: var(--fontWeight);
				text-transform: var(--textCase);
			}
		</style>
	</head>

	<body>
		
		<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}/>
		
		<h2>Sunt din brasov, fac facultate la paris</h2>
		<p>Alte lucruri despre mine</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Ma numesc {identity.firstName}</li>
			<li>Sunt {identity.occupation}</li>
			<li>M-am nascut in {identity.country}</li>
			{identity.hobbies.length >= 2 && 
			<li>Astea sunt doua dintre hobby-urile mele: {identity.hobbies[0]} si {identity.hobbies[1]}	</li>}
		</ul>

		<p>Astea sunt cateva dintre skill-urile mele:</p>
		<ul>
			{skills.map((skill) => <li class="skill">{skill}</li>)}
		</ul>

		{happy && <p>Sunt fericita cu viata mea</p>}
		{finished ? <p>Am terminat acest tutorial</p> : <p>Mai am de lucrat la tutorial</p>}
		{goal == 3 ? <p>As vrea sa termin tutorialul in 3 zile</p> : <p>Nu trebuie neaparat sa termin in 3 zile</p>} 

		<p>
			 Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Phasellus eu bibendum urna. Etiam facilisis est eget erat tempor, eget lobortis mi efficitur. Quisque felis massa, varius a condimentum eget, imperdiet finibus nibh. Vivamus porta lectus nec massa facilisis viverra. Quisque scelerisque, quam eget consectetur efficitur, ante nibh pharetra dolor, ac maximus tortor mi a erat. Aenean volutpat erat ac risus dignissim, at varius ante scelerisque. Pellentesque sed enim nec erat consequat placerat eget vitae dolor.
		</p>
		<p>
			Class aptent taciti sociosqu ad litora torquent per conubia nostra, per inceptos himenaeos. Donec eu lorem et ligula varius tempor. Praesent mollis laoreet blandit. Etiam at libero id leo faucibus condimentum id sed erat. Praesent dui ante, efficitur eu pharetra ut, rutrum et ipsum. Praesent ac tempor purus. Morbi pharetra mattis mauris ac tempor. Suspendisse id volutpat velit. Cras quam dui, facilisis ut gravida a, rutrum vel magna. 
		</p>
	
	</body>
</html>